            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.73</h2>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Scene templates and building blocks.</b> Start a 3D scene from a street, living room, dialogue or car interior template, and assemble sets from twelve road and room modules.</li>
<li><b>Object library with starter assets.</b> Import GLB models, search by category, calibrate real-world sizes and reuse instances. Eight stylised starter models are included.</li>
<li><b>Character clips and drawn camera paths.</b> Play bundled motion clips on figures, and sketch camera moves in a floor plan with height, timing and a preview before applying.</li>
<li><b>3D Paul camera work.</b> Framing for several subjects at once, subject tracking, and targeted shot edits that leave the rest of the animation untouched.</li>
<li><b>Meshy V7 and SAM 3 Body.</b> 3D object and person generation from a still image is now available.</li>
<li><b>Cleaner composer layout.</b> Toolbars and side panels adapt to the window width. Fixed the bottom of the composer being cut off at small window heights.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
